        <span class="stick-nav__title">Highlights of Verdi’s Don Carlo</span>
        <a class=" c-btn c-btn--book" data-button="book" href="https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/highlights-of-verdis-don-carlo/book/1355234">Book Now</a>    </div>
